/* AppKit.strings - 简体中文 */

/* iTermApplicationDelegate.swift - Tip 文字 */
"The **Toolbelt** provides a versatile, dockable sidebar that offers quick access to frequently used features and information. It supports multiple panels that can be displayed simultaneously, including clipboard history, recently opened directories, command history, a scratchpad for notes, and more." = "工具列提供了一个多功能的可停靠侧边栏，可以快速访问常用功能和信息。它支持同时顯示多个面板，包括剪貼簿历史、最近開啟的目錄、命令歷史、用于筆記的便签本等。";
"Splits the current session vertically, placing a new session in the right half. The new session inherits the profile of the current session, including any changes made in `Session > Edit Session`." = "垂直分割当前工作階段，将新工作階段放置在右半部分。新工作階段继承当前工作階段的設定檔，包括在「工作階段 > 編輯工作階段」中所做的任何更改。";
"Splits the current session horizontally, placing a new session in the bottom half. The new session inherits the profile of the current session, including any changes made in `Session > Edit Session`." = "水平分割当前工作階段，将新工作階段放置在下半部分。新工作階段继承当前工作階段的設定檔，包括在「工作階段 > 編輯工作階段」中所做的任何更改。";
"Prompts you to select a profile and then splits the current session vertically, placing the new session in the right half." = "提示您選擇一个設定檔，然后垂直分割当前工作階段，将新工作階段放置在右半部分。";
"Prompts you to select a profile and then splits the current session horizontally, placing the new session in the bottom half." = "提示您選擇一个設定檔，然后水平分割当前工作階段，将新工作階段放置在下半部分。";
"The **tmux Dashboard** helps you switch between tmux sessions, show and hide windows, and administer other features of tmux without needing to use tmux’s commands." = "tmux 仪表板帮助您在 tmux 工作階段之间切换、顯示和隱藏視窗，以及管理 tmux 的其他功能，而无需使用 tmux 的命令。";
"**Advanced Paste** lets you edit text before pasting, remove control characters, convert tabs, base64-encode, and perform regular expression substitutions. It also lets you fine-tune how quickly pasted text is sent." = "高级貼上允许您在貼上前編輯文字、刪除控制字符、转换制表符、进行 base64 编码以及执行正则表达式替换。它还允许您微调貼上文字的发送速度。";
"**Render Natively** shows a nicely formatted, syntax-highlighted rendition of a document. For example, Markdown renders beautifully. It also allows for horizontal scrolling, making it a convenient way to view log files." = "原生渲染顯示格式优美、语法高亮的文档渲染。例如，Markdown 渲染效果非常好。它还支持水平滚动，使其成为查看日志文件的便捷方式。";
"You’ll be prompted any time you paste text containing a newline. See also **Limit Multi-Line Paste Warning to Shell Prompt**." = "每当您貼上包含换行符的文字时，系统都会提示您。另请参阅「将多行貼上警告限制在 Shell 提示符」。";
"This is effective only when **Warn Before Multi-Line Paste** is enabled. It also requires Shell Integration. When enabled, it suppresses confirmation when pasting text containing a newline if you are not at a shell prompt." = "此选项仅在啟用「多行貼上前警告」时有效。它还需要 Shell 集成。啟用后，如果您不在 shell 提示符下，貼上包含换行符的文字时将不再需要确认。";
"If enabled, you’ll be prompted to confirm that you wish to send a newline when pasting a single line of text ending in a newline. Shell Integration is required." = "啟用后，当您貼上以换行符结尾的单行文字时，系统会提示您确认是否要发送换行符。需要 Shell 集成。";
"When selected at a shell prompt (provided Shell Integration is installed) or in the Composer, it sends the current command to the configured AI system along with a prompt for it to generate a command. If no input is provided, you’ll be asked to give instructions. The generated command goes into the Composer." = "在 shell 提示符下（前提是已安装 Shell 集成）或在編輯器中選擇时，它会将当前命令与提示一起发送到配置的 AI 系统以生成命令。如果未提供输入，系统会要求您提供指令。生成的命令将进入編輯器。";
"This is meant to be used at the shell prompt after executing a command. It requires Shell Integration. The output of the preceding (or selected) command is sent to AI, which annotates the output and opens a chat window for further discussion." = "此功能旨在在 shell 提示符下执行命令后使用。它需要 Shell 集成。前一个（或选定）命令的输出被发送到 AI，AI 会对输出进行註解并開啟對話視窗以供进一步讨论。";
"Snippets are pieces of text that you save to reuse later. They’re great for frequently used commands, hard-to-remember directories, and much more." = "程式碼片段是您儲存以供日后重复使用的文字片段。它们非常适合用于常用命令、难以记住的目錄等等。";
"Actions are saved instructions for iTerm2. For example, you could create an action that opens a new window and then creates a split pane." = "操作是为 iTerm2 儲存的指令。例如，您可以创建一个操作来開啟一个新視窗，然后创建一个分割窗格。";
"Records the current width of the toolbelt for use in newly created windows." = "记录工具列的当前宽度，以便在新创建的視窗中使用。";
"When enabled, dividers rendered by programs like vim or emacs are detected, and text selection wraps around them." = "啟用后，可以检测到 vim 或 emacs 等程序渲染的分隔线，文字選擇会围绕它们自動换行。";
"**Filter** allows you to hide any lines that do not match a search query, which can be a substring or regular expression. It updates live as new text arrives." = "过滤器允许您隱藏与搜尋查询不匹配的行，搜尋查询可以是子字符串或正则表达式。当新文字到达时，它会实时更新。";
"A **Mark** appears as a blue triangle in the left margin. You can easily navigate among marks using **Jump to Mark**, **Next Mark**, and **Previous Mark**. If Shell Integration is enabled, a Mark is automatically added at each shell prompt." = "標記以蓝色三角形出现在左边距中。您可以使用「跳转到標記」、「下一个標記」和「上一个標記」轻松在標記之间导航。如果啟用了 Shell 集成，则每个 shell 提示符处会自動添加標記。";
"A **Named Mark** appears as a blue triangle in the left margin. In addition to being easy to navigate with **Next Mark** and **Previous Mark**, you can also find Named Marks in the Toolbelt’s **Named Marks** tool." = "命名標記以蓝色三角形出现在左边距中。除了可以使用「下一个標記」和「上一个標記」轻松导航外，您还可以在工具列的「命名標記」工具中找到命名標記。";
"A **Named Mark** appears as a blue triangle in the left margin. In addition to being easy to navigate with **Next Mark** and **Previous Mark**, you can also find Named Marks in this Toolbelt tool." = "命名標記以蓝色三角形出现在左边距中。除了可以使用「下一个標記」和「上一个標記」轻松导航外，您还可以在此工具列工具中找到命名標記。";
"**Fold** lets you collapse multiple lines into a single line to hide distracting text. You can always unfold it by clicking the arrow in the margin, selecting the text and using **Edit > Unfold in Selection**, or right-clicking and choosing **Unfold**." = "摺疊允许您将多行合并为一行以隱藏干扰文字。您始终可以通过单击边距中的箭头、選擇文字并使用「編輯 > 在選擇中展开」，或右键单击并選擇「展开」来展开它。";
"**Captured Output** works in conjunction with a Trigger to detect interesting text in the terminal and make it easy to find. The Toolbelt tool shows a list of captured text. You can click to navigate to it or double-click to enter a programmable command. This is useful for finding errors in the output of a build command, for example. It requires Shell Integration." = "擷取输出与觸發器配合使用，可以检测終端中的有趣文字并使其易于查找。工具列工具顯示擷取文字的列表。您可以单击以导航到它，或双击以输入可编程命令。这对于查找构建命令输出中的错误很有用。它需要 Shell 集成。";
"**Codecierge** uses AI to help you achieve a goal. Tell it what you want to do, and it can watch your terminal to interpret output and suggest commands. Shell Integration is required." = "Codecierge 使用 AI 帮助您实现目标。告诉它您想做什么，它可以监视您的終端以解释输出并建议命令。需要 Shell 集成。";
"If Shell Integration is installed, **Command History** shows a searchable list of recently run commands on the current host." = "如果安装了 Shell 集成，命令歷史記錄会顯示当前主机上最近執行的命令的可搜尋列表。";
"**Notes** is a single, persistent notepad in your Toolbelt. It’s useful for keeping track of what you’re doing or composing messages." = "筆記是您工具列中的单个持久记事本。它对于跟踪您正在做的事情或撰写消息很有用。";
"**Paste History** shows text that you have copied and pasted in iTerm2. You can configure it to be saved long term." = "貼上歷史記錄顯示您在 iTerm2 中複製和貼上的文字。您可以将其配置为长期儲存。";
"Shows a list of your profiles so you can create new sessions easily." = "顯示您的設定檔列表，以便您可以轻松创建新工作階段。";
"Shows your most used directories, sorted by a combination of frequency and recency of use. Requires Shell Integration." = "顯示您最常用的目錄，按使用频率和最近使用时间的组合排序。需要 Shell 集成。";
"Hides everything except the lines of selected text to remove distractions." = "隱藏除选定文字行之外的所有内容以消除干扰。";
"Highlights the location of the cursor and unhides it if it is currently hidden." = "高亮顯示光标的位置，如果当前隱藏则取消隱藏。";
"Annotations are inline markup. When closed, they appear as a yellow underline; when open, they look like yellow stickies where you can write memos about content in the terminal window." = "註解是内联標記。關閉时，它们顯示为黄色下划线；開啟时，它们看起来像黄色便签，您可以在其中撰写有关終端視窗内容的备忘录。";
"The Composer is a window within the terminal where you can edit text using macOS-native controls. It does syntax highlighting, command and filename completion—even over SSH (provided you use SSH Integration). If AI features are enabled, you can also get AI-powered suggestions. You can even have multiple cursors! When you’re ready, you can send the whole buffer or just a line at a time to your shell." = "編輯器是終端内的一个視窗，您可以在其中使用 macOS 原生控件編輯文字。它支持语法高亮、命令和文件名补全——甚至可以通过 SSH（前提是您使用 SSH 集成）。如果啟用了 AI 功能，您还可以获得 AI 驱动的建议。您甚至可以有多个光标！当您准备好时，您可以将整个緩衝区或一次一行地发送到您的 shell。";
"**Auto Composer** replaces your shell prompt with a macOS-native text field. It does syntax highlighting and command and filename completion. You can also enable AI-powered suggestions. Shell Integration is required." = "自動編輯器用 macOS 原生文字字段替换您的 shell 提示符。它支持语法高亮以及命令和文件名补全。您还可以啟用 AI 驱动的建议。需要 Shell 集成。";
"**Open Quickly** provides quick access to many common actions. You can use it to find a session by typing its name, directory, hostname, or recent command. You can also use it to switch profiles or create a new window by typing the name of a profile. Restore an arrangement by entering its name. Press `/` to get tips for quick commands." = "快速開啟提供了对许多常见操作的快速访问。您可以通过输入工作階段名称、目錄、主机名或最近的命令来查找工作階段。您还可以通过输入設定檔名称来切换設定檔或创建新視窗。通过输入名称来恢复排列。按 `/` 获取快速命令提示。";
"**Instant Replay** lets you review recent terminal history. It’s handy if something just disappeared from the screen and it isn’t in scrollback history." = "即时回放让您查看最近的終端歷史記錄。如果某些内容刚刚从屏幕上消失且不在滚动歷史記錄中，它会非常方便。";
"A **Coprocess** is a program that automates interactions in the terminal. Input to the terminal is redirected to stdin of the coprocess, and its output is sent back to the terminal as though the coprocess were typing." = "協同程序是一个自動执行終端交互的程序。終端的输入被重定向到協同程序的标准输入，其输出被发送回終端，就像協同程序在输入一样。";
"Stops the active coprocess. Input to the terminal is no longer redirected to the coprocess, and its output ceases." = "停止活动的協同程序。終端的输入不再重定向到協同程序，其输出也会停止。";
"**Triggers** are actions the terminal performs automatically when text matching a regular expression is received. For example, you can highlight text or display an alert." = "觸發器是終端在接收到与正则表达式匹配的文字时自動执行的操作。例如，您可以高亮顯示文字或顯示警报。";
"When enabled, control characters are displayed visually rather than being interpreted as usual." = "啟用后，控制字符以视觉方式顯示，而不是按常规方式解释。";
"This mode is generally not recommended. **Disambiguate Escape** is a more modern approach." = "通常不建议使用此模式。**消除歧义转义**是一种更现代的方法。";
"Buried sessions are hidden in the **Buried Sessions** menu below and do not appear in any window. These are particularly useful for the session where you initiate tmux integration by running `tmux -CC`." = "已隐藏的工作階段隱藏在下方的「已隐藏工作階段」菜单中，不会出现在任何視窗中。这些对于您通过執行 `tmux -CC` 启动 tmux 集成的工作階段特别有用。";
"The Python REPL opens a window running a special Python interpreter that lets you experiment with iTerm2’s Python API. You can use `await` at the top level of the interpreter." = "Python REPL 開啟一个執行特殊 Python 解释器的視窗，让您可以尝试 iTerm2 的 Python API。您可以在解释器的顶层使用 `await`。";
"Opens a UI where you can add, update, or remove pip dependencies of a Python API script." = "開啟一个界面，您可以在其中添加、更新或刪除 Python API 指令碼的 pip 依赖项。";
"iTerm2’s Python Runtime is a large binary package (hundreds of MBs) that enables the Python API by installing a pre-built Python environment that scripts can use." = "iTerm2 的 Python 執行时是一个大型二进制包（数百 MB），通过安装指令碼可以使用的预构建 Python 环境来啟用 Python API。";
"Use **Import** to install scripts others have shared with you. These scripts have the `.its` extension." = "使用「导入」来安装他人与您共享的指令碼。这些指令碼具有 `.its` 扩展名。";
"If you want to share Python API scripts, you can export them to an `.its` file. If you have a code signing certificate and private key in your Keychain, you can also sign the `.its` file." = "如果您想共享 Python API 指令碼，可以将它们导出为 `.its` 文件。如果您的钥匙串中有代码签名证书和私钥，您还可以对 `.its` 文件进行签名。";
"View errors and low-level communication between Python API scripts and iTerm2 here.\n\nThe Inspector can be accessed from the Console. It allows you to browse variables in sessions, tabs, and windows." = "在此处查看 Python API 指令碼与 iTerm2 之间的错误和低级通信。\n\n检查器可以从控制台访问。它允许您浏览工作階段、索引標籤和視窗中的变量。";
"**Window Arrangements** are a saved record of one or more windows, their tabs, and split panes, including how each pane is configured. They do not include content. They’re a quick way to create a working environment with multiple sessions in various configurations." = "視窗排列是一个或多个視窗、其索引標籤和分割窗格的儲存记录，包括每个窗格的配置方式。它们不包括内容。它们是创建具有各种配置的多个工作階段的工作环境的快速方式。";
"The **Password Manager** helps you keep track of your passwords securely. By default, it stores them in the macOS Keychain, but it can also use 1Password or LastPass." = "密碼管理器帮助您安全地跟踪密碼。默认情况下，它将密碼存储在 macOS 钥匙串中，但也可以使用 1Password 或 LastPass。";
"**AI Chats** opens a chat window where you can interact with AI. It can optionally view and control the terminal if you grant it permission." = "AI 對話開啟一个對話視窗，您可以在其中与 AI 交互。如果您授予权限，它可以選擇性地查看和控制終端。";
"A **pinned** Hotkey Window does not close automatically when it loses keyboard focus." = "固定的快捷键視窗在失去鍵盤焦点时不会自動關閉。";
"Checks whether the GPU Renderer is currently being used in the active session. This is sometimes useful for debugging." = "检查活动工作階段中是否正在使用 GPU 渲染器。这有时对偵錯很有用。";
"**Secure Keyboard Entry** prevents other programs from intercepting your keystrokes in the terminal. However, it also breaks some functionality: other programs cannot activate their windows while this is enabled. For example, the `open` command will still open an app, but it won’t be activated." = "安全鍵盤输入可以防止其他程序拦截您在終端中的击键。但是，它也会破坏一些功能：啟用此功能后，其他程序无法激活其視窗。例如，`open` 命令仍然会開啟应用程序，但不会被激活。";
"**Shell Integration** consists of shell scripts that run when you log in. They inform iTerm2 of where your shell prompt is. This enables dozens of useful features such as command history, directory history, AI features, and more." = "Shell 集成由登录时執行的 shell 指令碼组成。它们通知 iTerm2 您的 shell 提示符在哪里。这啟用了许多有用的功能，如命令歷史記錄、目錄歷史記錄、AI 功能等。";
"Debug logs are saved in memory while this setting is enabled and written to `/tmp/debuglog.txt` when you turn it off. Memory use is capped at about 200MB; if the log grows past that, the oldest entries are discarded so the most recent activity is always kept." = "啟用此設定后，偵錯日志儲存在内存中，關閉时写入 `/tmp/debuglog.txt`。内存使用上限约为 200MB；如果日志超过此大小，最旧的条目将被丢弃，以便始终保留最近的活动。";
"When enabled, anything you type in this window is sent to all sessions in this window." = "啟用后，您在此視窗中键入的任何内容都会发送到此視窗中的所有工作階段。";
"When enabled, anything you type in this tab is sent to all sessions in this tab." = "啟用后，您在此索引標籤中键入的任何内容都会发送到此索引標籤中的所有工作階段。";
"Adds or removes this session from the set of sessions in this window that have broadcast enabled. When you type in a session with broadcast enabled, the keystrokes are sent to all other sessions in the same window that have broadcast enabled." = "从此視窗中已啟用廣播的工作階段集中添加或刪除此工作階段。当您在已啟用廣播的工作階段中键入内容时，击键将发送到同一視窗中已啟用廣播的所有其他工作階段。";
"When enabled, prominent red lines are drawn in the background to indicate that text you type is being broadcast to other sessions." = "啟用后，背景中会绘制醒目的红线，表示您键入的文字正在廣播到其他工作階段。";
"When enabled, typing in this session is broadcast to other sessions in the same broadcast domain. Typing in other sessions sends input only to those sessions." = "啟用后，在此工作階段中键入的内容将廣播到同一廣播域中的其他工作階段。在其他工作階段中键入的内容仅发送到这些工作階段。";
"Locked windows resist being resized. This can be useful when macOS screws up your windows when connecting or disconnecting displays." = "鎖定的視窗不会被调整大小。当 macOS 在连接或断开顯示器时搞乱您的視窗时，这很有用。";
"When a window’s layout is locked, its tabs and panes can’t be added, closed, reordered, dragged, or moved to another window, so a stray click or drag can’t rearrange it. Resizing panes, opening new windows, and closing the window still work. This is an alternative to Lock Size; turning one on turns the other off." = "当視窗的版面配置被鎖定时，其索引標籤和窗格无法添加、關閉、重新排序、拖动或移动到另一个視窗，因此误点击或拖动不会重新排列它。调整窗格大小、開啟新視窗和關閉視窗仍然有效。这是鎖定大小的替代方案；開啟一个会關閉另一个。";
"When enabled, the next time any session in this window changes its status (such as waiting, idle, or busy) an alert is shown and this setting turns itself back off. This is the same toggle as the bell button in the **Session Status** toolbelt tool, which must be open for this to be available." = "啟用后，下次此視窗中的任何工作階段更改其狀態（如等待、空闲或忙碌）时，会顯示警报，此設定会自動關閉。这与工作階段狀態工具列工具中的钟形按钮是同一个开关，该工具必须開啟才能使用此功能。";
"While Buffer Input is turned on, keyboard input is stored in a buffer. It will be sent when Buffer Input is turned off. You can also configure a trigger to change the Buffer Input setting." = "当緩衝输入开启时，鍵盤输入存储在緩衝区中。当緩衝输入關閉时，它将被发送。您还可以配置觸發器来更改緩衝输入設定。";
"The **Session Status** tool shows the status of sessions across all tabs. Statuses can be set by the **Set Tab Status** trigger or by programs using a control sequence. Each entry shows the session name, a colored indicator dot, status text, and a keyboard shortcut to jump to that session." = "工作階段狀態工具顯示所有索引標籤中工作階段的狀態。狀態可以通过「設定索引標籤狀態」觸發器或使用控制序列的程序来設定。每个条目顯示工作階段名称、彩色指示点、狀態文字和跳转到该工作階段的鍵盤快捷键。";

/* CommandURLHandler.swift - URL 命令處理 */
"Run on %@ via ssh" = "通過 ssh 在 %@ 上執行";
"Run as %@" = "以 %@ 身份執行";
"Run in directory %@" = "在目錄 %@ 中執行";
"Open in tab offered" = "在提供的索引標籤中開啟";
"Run in current session offered" = "在目前工作階段中執行";
"Command:" = "命令：";
"Username" = "使用者名稱";
"Username:" = "使用者名稱：";
"Directory" = "目錄";
"Directory:" = "目錄：";
